The term New BSD license is associated with the BSD-3-Clause license and not with the BSD-2-Clasue license. We also checked the given link https://pear.php.net/package/archive_tar/ the license information on the page lists New BSD license with a link. When clicking on the link the text of the BSD-2-Clause licenes is displayed thuse we only concluded BSD-2-Clause as license of this file.
The information was retreived on 27 of Aug 2026

