The information in the file is:
@license http://www.opensource.org/licenses/bsd-license.php New BSD License
The link points to the BSD-2-Clause license, but the name New BSD License refers to the BSD-3-Clause license. We concluded here BSD-3-Clause as license of this file, because the name is explicitly mentioned and internet links are volatile. We took the license text from https://opensource.org/license/bsd-3-clause
There is a small risk that this is not the correct license text
The information was retreived on 26th of Aug 2026

